WEBVTT

00:09.690 --> 00:13.490
The scent of the flower
is half of what we are.

00:15.030 --> 00:16.490
Do not lose sight of it.

00:20.450 --> 00:26.000
It is a mark, so that we do
not forget where it all began.

00:26.880 --> 00:28.000
A mark?

00:28.340 --> 00:33.010
It is the price of fulfilling the
promise that we abandoned

00:33.630 --> 00:36.429
I was unable to find it...

00:36.430 --> 00:40.010
as was my grandfather,
and his grandfather before him.

00:43.850 --> 00:45.190
But you...

00:49.770 --> 00:52.820
Perhaps you will be able to reach it.

01:52.040 --> 01:55.710
Carry me to where those flowers grow.

02:54.860 --> 02:57.480
You, who grant my wish...

03:00.070 --> 03:01.450
Would you...

03:04.240 --> 03:07.200
..give yourself to me?

03:14.230 --> 03:15.290
Coming, coming.

03:16.190 --> 03:18.471
I'm about to go on break
so if you could keep it short...

03:29.770 --> 03:31.059
Please..

03:31.060 --> 03:32.980
Look at Taki.

03:40.861 --> 03:47.990
Izu

03:40.861 --> 03:47.990
presents

03:42.200 --> 03:45.095
Chapter 2

03:45.096 --> 03:47.949
The Flower of the Song of Heaven

03:59.810 --> 04:02.009
Don't just stand hovering
there, you hulking lout.

04:02.010 --> 04:03.010
You're distracting me.

04:03.770 --> 04:04.930
Sit down.

04:14.940 --> 04:17.230
This will keep him asleep for a while.

04:27.410 --> 04:30.240
Captain Klaus von Wolfstadt.

04:31.560 --> 04:36.040
Is is safe for me to assume that I can draw the
most natural conclusions from Taki-sama's injuries?

05:01.040 --> 05:02.610
Rabid dog.

05:03.210 --> 05:05.859
Turn the other way, you brute.

05:05.860 --> 05:07.470
Y-yes...

05:22.260 --> 05:23.630
What cruelty.

05:27.650 --> 05:30.050
Forbidden lust, forbidden wine...

05:30.850 --> 05:32.310
and sensual pleasures.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.625
Note

05:33.710 --> 05:37.870
Each generation of the Reizen family has served as a
flowers of the Son of Heaven since time immemorial.

05:35.626 --> 05:37.690
"Heavenly Son" refers to the emperor.

05:37.980 --> 05:41.270
To be deflowered and
sullied outside of wedlock...

05:42.600 --> 05:44.030
It is unthinkable!

05:45.620 --> 05:47.780
It is a disgrace punishable by death!

05:50.730 --> 05:55.410
And for a division commander, who must be physically
and spirituality pure on the battlefield...!

05:56.200 --> 05:57.500
What did you say?

05:58.400 --> 06:01.170
You didn't know, barbarian?

06:01.980 --> 06:05.170
The flower of the Son of
Heaven, Maiden Rose...

06:06.170 --> 06:08.840
the flower which must not be broken!

06:11.190 --> 06:17.180
How do you think a stripling just barely twenty, is
able to command an army of twenty thousand soldiers?

06:18.520 --> 06:21.859
Because his bloodline and his chastity
are protected by the grace of the gods!

06:21.860 --> 06:22.860
That's ridiculous!

06:23.650 --> 06:25.529
You're still clinging to
such an old superstition?

06:25.530 --> 06:27.490
It isn't superstition to us!

06:28.780 --> 06:32.100
We need a pillar of support, something no
lofty ideals or worthy cause can give us.

06:32.200 --> 06:35.079
A pillar for our spirits...

06:35.080 --> 06:37.200
in the shape of a man.

06:50.650 --> 06:51.890
That can't be...

06:53.330 --> 06:55.099
Go back to your room.

06:55.100 --> 06:56.199
No, I'll...

06:56.200 --> 06:57.270
Get he hell out!

06:59.170 --> 07:02.400
Before I shoot you dead
right where you stand! Get out!

07:24.540 --> 07:25.959
Please take care...

07:25.960 --> 07:26.960
of Taki.

07:31.830 --> 07:32.880
Please.

07:57.910 --> 08:01.540
Seems Eurota is massing
it's troops in North Velen.

08:02.040 --> 08:04.170
It's got the higher-ups all on edge.

08:05.670 --> 08:06.710
Please excuse me.

08:11.300 --> 08:12.759
You were waiting?

08:12.760 --> 08:13.800
What did they say?

08:14.720 --> 08:16.430
I'm being deported.

08:17.600 --> 08:19.600
It can't be helped, in times like this.

08:33.820 --> 08:36.740
Hey there, Sir Asian Aristocratic.

08:37.910 --> 08:40.330
I hear you're scurrying back
on home already, is that right?

08:41.160 --> 08:44.580
Your tiny people are more suited to
those old-fashioned tanks anyway.

08:45.370 --> 08:48.130
Just go run crying to
Eurote, like you did before.

08:49.540 --> 08:50.540
Klaus!

08:52.840 --> 08:55.050
This is the price of
my grandfather's folly.

08:55.550 --> 08:57.930
I must bear the censure.

09:09.610 --> 09:11.190
How long do you intend to follow me?!

09:11.730 --> 09:14.440
Until you go back to your room.

09:19.070 --> 09:21.079
Finally, you look at me.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.080
I figured you were crying again.

09:24.040 --> 09:25.580
As if I would.

09:34.760 --> 09:37.590
This is the last of the
laburnum flowers this season.

09:38.340 --> 09:41.469
There was a similar flower in
your country too, remember?

09:41.470 --> 09:44.469
It blossomed around
this time too, didn't it?

09:44.470 --> 09:46.810
What's that flower called?

09:50.810 --> 09:56.860
The cluster of violet flowers swaying
in the sea breeze just like snow.

09:57.610 --> 10:01.870
It was so beautiful, I almost
feel like it was all a dream.

10:03.240 --> 10:07.369
A year ago, when I first met you...

10:07.370 --> 10:10.960
for some reason, I
thought of that flower.

10:17.260 --> 10:19.380
Strange, isn't it?

10:19.590 --> 10:22.389
Here I am, in a country tens
of thousands of miles away...

10:22.390 --> 10:25.310
and yet my mind is full of
thoughts of that distant flower.

10:31.440 --> 10:32.440
Taki.

10:32.980 --> 10:35.900
What if you came to my country?

10:38.360 --> 10:42.200
I am the second son so I don't own
any land, but I have a small house.

10:42.950 --> 10:45.240
And the rose garden
my older sister left behind

10:46.990 --> 10:49.620
The white roses are
exquisite in the rainy season.

10:50.670 --> 10:51.670
Come on!

10:52.500 --> 10:53.670
I'll work out somehow.

10:55.130 --> 10:58.630
Doing whatever needs to be
done, earning your daily bread.

10:59.340 --> 11:01.510
I don't think it's such a bad life.

11:04.350 --> 11:07.140
The people of my estate need my protection.

11:07.970 --> 11:09.520
I cannot desert them.

11:10.180 --> 11:14.020
Those people are the members
of your division, aren't they?

11:14.520 --> 11:18.360
When the war starts
they'll be the very first to die.

11:18.940 --> 11:21.820
Right there, during the very
battle you're commanding...

11:21.990 --> 11:25.409
the same smiling peasant farmer
that brought you milk the day before...

11:25.410 --> 11:28.080
will come back to you today in pieces.

11:29.000 --> 11:32.750
And that will continue, day
after day, until the war ends.

11:33.210 --> 11:34.290
Every day!

11:34.960 --> 11:36.750
Can you bear that?

11:41.130 --> 11:43.640
It's far better than
staying outside, helpless!

11:44.430 --> 11:46.469
I am the lord of my people!

11:46.470 --> 11:48.810
I'm in the position to protect them!

11:49.430 --> 11:52.390
I'll extend my hand to the and
protect them with all my power!

11:53.690 --> 11:56.876
If the alternative is to unknowingly let them
die in some forsaken ditch out of my sight,

11:56.900 --> 12:01.070
then no matter how terrible it is, I
will stand with them on that battlefield!

12:09.450 --> 12:11.160
Ah...

12:11.750 --> 12:13.370
Such beautiful eyes.

12:14.710 --> 12:17.380
That's exactly why you are my flower.

12:32.270 --> 12:33.850
Can I sit beside you?

12:53.160 --> 12:55.250
I want to kiss you.

13:13.850 --> 13:15.850
It really is the same fragrance.

13:17.900 --> 13:18.900
Taki...

13:20.730 --> 13:23.030
The boy I met that day... was that you?

13:32.450 --> 13:34.370
You wished for it, didn't you?

13:35.910 --> 13:38.370
This is no coincidence... right?

13:57.180 --> 13:58.810
I'm going to make love to you.

14:17.160 --> 14:18.250
Klaus...

14:22.290 --> 14:24.750
Is this the first time you've been touched?

14:28.090 --> 14:29.840
<i>No one else has kissed these lips?</i>

14:43.980 --> 14:45.860
Or heard your voice?

15:25.020 --> 15:28.610
<i>This sweet scent of flowers...</i>

15:30.490 --> 15:31.860
Klaus.

15:32.660 --> 15:35.490
There are people who are like flowers.

15:37.080 --> 15:42.290
And we are helpless to
go against that sweetness.

15:44.830 --> 15:47.300
You have golden eyes.

15:48.960 --> 15:53.430
If only you were my knight...

15:56.730 --> 15:57.850
Shit!

15:58.940 --> 16:00.849
Dammit!

16:00.850 --> 16:01.940
I...

16:12.620 --> 16:18.790
Captain Klaus von Wolfstadt was arrest at 10:08 this
morning in the inner courtyard of the officer's residence.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.079
Has a report been made to
the general headquarters?

16:22.080 --> 16:23.209
Not yet, sir.

16:23.210 --> 16:25.790
Don't let even a whisper of this leak out.

16:26.500 --> 16:29.459
If it were made known that the division commander's
knight had been arrested on suspicion of treason...

16:29.460 --> 16:32.719
Of course. It would be
an outrageous scandal.

16:32.720 --> 16:35.760
What should we tell taki-sama?

16:38.020 --> 16:40.060
Wait some time before speaking with him.

16:40.520 --> 16:44.479
I heard he had come down
with a fever. What's his condition?

16:44.480 --> 16:46.270
It's just fatigue.

16:46.730 --> 16:49.020
Second Lieutenant Suguri is with him now.

16:50.710 --> 16:52.280
And the captain..?

16:52.870 --> 16:57.030
He is currently under interrogation by Grand
Chamberlain Hasebe and the military police.

17:00.210 --> 17:02.289
What's that dazed look in your eyes?

17:02.290 --> 17:04.460
I want answers to my
questions and i want them <i>now</i>!

17:07.270 --> 17:09.250
You'll have to excuse me.

17:09.870 --> 17:13.300
Truth is I haven't been getting
much sleep these past few nights

17:14.340 --> 17:17.510
so I tend to doze off
during boring conversations.

17:23.830 --> 17:27.230
You have neither
citizenship, not human rights

17:27.980 --> 17:33.150
In other words, I can treat you however I damn well please
and no war crimes tribunal is going to come to your rescue.

17:34.940 --> 17:36.490
I'll ask you again.

17:37.170 --> 17:39.569
The maps and the other
documents you discarded were...

17:39.570 --> 17:44.290
filled with precise information detailing the military
situation of our forces and of the Western alliance.

17:44.810 --> 17:46.250
What is is you're after?

18:03.850 --> 18:05.220
Major Uemura!

18:06.370 --> 18:09.020
Klaus-sama isn't a spy!

18:10.110 --> 18:12.069
He would never do anything like that..!

18:12.070 --> 18:13.150
Silence!

18:21.660 --> 18:22.740
Taki-sama.

18:33.340 --> 18:34.750
<i>I understand it now.</i>

18:36.250 --> 18:40.260
<i>That beautiful language, like
the sound of little birds chirping.</i>

18:42.090 --> 18:46.720
<i>That quiet wish that I
could not have understood...</i>

18:47.720 --> 18:54.730
If only you and I could go far, far away,
to the other side of this sky...

19:01.160 --> 19:03.570
Who are you working for?!

19:04.120 --> 19:05.749
Answer me!

19:05.750 --> 19:13.750
I am Captain Klaus von Wolfstadt, member
of the 15th Division, "Rosen Maiden,"

19:13.840 --> 19:18.840
and the one and only knight of
Division Commander Taki Reizen!

19:25.350 --> 19:27.560
Seems I won't be getting
anything useful out of you.

19:28.120 --> 19:30.770
I acknowledge you as a
warrior, in name if nothing else,

19:31.690 --> 19:34.980
and I will at least give you
the honor of dying on a blade!

19:43.030 --> 19:44.700
Stand down.

19:51.830 --> 19:54.000
Do not touch my knight.

20:02.240 --> 20:02.840
Ta-Taki-sama!

20:02.840 --> 20:03.840
Ta-Taki-sama!

20:04.340 --> 20:05.640
Why are you here?!

20:06.040 --> 20:07.549
Taki, you...

20:07.550 --> 20:08.599
Taki, you...

20:08.600 --> 20:09.640
Your body...

20:34.290 --> 20:34.750
B-But Taki-sama,

20:34.751 --> 20:36.369
B-But Taki-sama,

20:36.370 --> 20:39.019
this man is under suspicion of treason!

20:39.020 --> 20:42.510
I gave Klaus secret orders
to conduct the investigation.

20:43.670 --> 20:48.850
I told him to use his old connections to
probe the movements of the Western alliance.

20:49.690 --> 20:50.100
B-But...

20:50.100 --> 20:50.680
B-But...

20:50.681 --> 20:54.730
The-Then, why couldn't he answer
my questions during the interrogation?

20:55.220 --> 20:59.480
Because I instructed him to
maintain the utmost secrecy.

21:00.780 --> 21:03.150
Klaus carried out my orders to the end,

21:04.450 --> 21:06.200
exactly as I wished.

21:16.350 --> 21:17.580
You endured well,

21:18.240 --> 21:19.290
my knight.

21:22.800 --> 21:23.800
Taki...

21:39.900 --> 21:40.900
Taki-sama!

21:42.170 --> 21:50.170
In the future, if Klaus should
ever deceive or betray me

21:51.420 --> 21:55.000
then I will settle it by my own hand.

22:03.900 --> 22:05.210
Understood.

22:05.800 --> 22:08.880
But please be aware that
there will not be a next time.

22:37.670 --> 22:39.579
I smell... flowers...

22:39.580 --> 22:40.670
I smell... flowers...

22:44.310 --> 22:46.510
Don't force yourself
if it's difficult to speak.

22:47.890 --> 22:48.919
Why did you... help me?

22:48.920 --> 22:50.180
Why did you... help me?

22:51.360 --> 22:52.800
Don't leave my side.

22:53.960 --> 22:56.560
Don't go beyond my reach.

22:57.600 --> 22:59.269
My Knight...

22:59.270 --> 23:01.690
I am the only one who
controls your destiny!

23:03.210 --> 23:04.210
Yes...

